 the...?\\nWhat are you doing?\\r","msg_0384_R34_00025":"","msg_0384_R34_00026":"Jenn: Better not laugh yet.\\nMy sister is really strong!","msg_0384_R34_00027":"Jenn: You and us... We might as well\\nbecome friends!","msg_0384_R34_00028":"Kate: I must pay you back for taking\\ncare of my sisters!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00029":"","msg_0384_R34_00030":"Kate: You are so strong.\\nWe lost with no excuses...\\rHere, take this!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00031":"","msg_0384_R34_00032":"Kate: I’m sorry we jumped you.\\rWe never expected anyone to find \\nus here.\\fYou sure startled us.","msg_0384_R34_00033":"Rt. 34\\nSouth to Azalea Town","msg_0384_R34_00034":"Trainer Tips\\rNorth to Goldenrod City\\nThe Radio Tower at Goldenrod is giving\\faway Radio Cards.\\rAnswer their questions and receive a\\nRadio Card!","msg_0384_R34_00035":"Pokémon Day Care\\nLet us raise your Pokémon for you!","msg_0384_R34_00036":"Lyra: Grandpa!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00037":"Lyra: Good work, Grandpa!\\nThe Pokémon you raised for me has\\fbeen as healthy as can be!\\rYou look fit, too!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00038":"Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00039":"Let me introduce you.\\nThis is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. He’s a Trainer.\\rHe seems to be getting better at\\nraising Pokémon.\\rWell, not as good as you, Grandpa,\\nof course!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00040":"Follow me, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00041":"Ethan: Grandpa!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00042":"Ethan: Good work, Grandpa!\\nThe Pokémon you raised for me has\\fbeen as healthy as can be!\\rYou look fit, too!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00043":"Ethan: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00044":"Let me introduce you.\\nThis is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. She’s a Trainer.\\rShe seems to be getting better at\\nraising Pokémon.\\rWell, not as good as you, Grandpa,\\nof course!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00045":"Follow me, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\r","msg_0384_R34_00046":"I have an idea!\\nI’ll give you our numbers.\\rThen you can check on the Pokémon\\nwe raise for you.\\r","msg_0